WEBVTT

00:24:59.163 --> 00:25:01.204
Very clearly communicated to me

00:25:01.204 --> 00:25:09.288
and my two younger siblings that we could
do anything and as black kids in

00:25:09.288 --> 00:25:12.163
the Deep South in the 80s, that
probably wasn't true.

00:25:13.121 --> 00:25:15.621
But they convinced us of that anyway,

00:25:15.829 --> 00:25:23.288
and I think between that and their
very clear expectation that

00:25:23.329 --> 00:25:27.496
the obligation that we had was not just
to do whatever we wanted to do

00:25:27.496 --> 00:25:29.746
and aspire to whatever we wanted
to aspire towards,

00:25:29.746 --> 00:25:34.496
it was to make sure that we made it more
likely that anybody had more of